# the knobs they set belong to that preset: the effect, and the engine's (PIANO here, the cutoff of a lead).
# another preset brings its own. this one, turned back on, has every knob where they left it.
# an instrument, a part, a mood and ERASE ALL do not put a different effect on.
wait 300
listen
tap HOME
wait 100
tapkey w0
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
expect track 0
page 11
turn K2 1
wait 80
turn K2 -1
wait 80
expect part 0
page 2
row 0
press HOME
tapkey w0
release HOME
wait 80
expect preset 0
turn K1 15
wait 40
expect p1 55
row 3
turn K1 4
wait 40
expect fx 6
row 2
turn K2 5
wait 40
expect fxamt 20
turn K4 5
wait 40
expect echo 17
